note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Ampere policy and QMD ABI words over amp_runtime (om/encoder/amp_runtime.om, composed before this file).
note src/omega_ampere_qmd.c only forwards pointers; this unit owns the amp_runtime m layout, the acceptance
note test and the narrowing of the 64 zero-extended QMD words to little-endian uint32 bytes.
note op 0 policy: a is the caller m vector, passed to amp_runtime unchanged and without a metadata copy.
note op 1 build: a[0..8] = code,cbank,semaphore,threadsX,threadsY,gridX,gridY,registers,sharedBytes,
note which become amp_runtime op 3 m[1..9]. a[9..15] are ignored.
note q receives 64 little-endian uint32 words (256 bytes) only when amp_runtime accepts.
note Return 1 accepted, 0 refused (unknown op included).
fn amp_qle q edit uchar 256 o ulong v ulong to void
put q o uchar and v 255
put q add o 1 uchar and shr v 8 255
put q add o 2 uchar and shr v 16 255
put q add o 3 uchar and shr v 24 255
end
fn amp_qpolicy a view ulong 16 q edit uchar 256 to ulong
w = new ulong 64 0
if ne amp_runtime a w 1
ret 0
end
for i ulong 64
amp_qle q mul i 4 get w i
end
ret 1
end
fn amp_qmd op ulong a view ulong 16 q edit uchar 256 to ulong
if eq op 0
ret amp_qpolicy a q
end
if ne op 1
ret 0
end
m = new ulong 16 0
put m 0 3
for i ulong 9
put m add i 1 get a i
end
ret amp_qpolicy m q
end
